Sokha's parents have been married for twenty years. His father is his mother's husband, and his mother is his father's wife. Sokha has two siblings. His older sister has a boyfriend, and his brother has a girlfriend. His aunt's partner is a doctor. When his sister marries, her husband's parents will be her in-laws.

